WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.763
AIR. Show tiny particles travelling with air between spaces.

00:00:04.617 --> 00:00:08.371
EXAMPLE. Show a label for measles as a disease, cough as a symptom.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.653
COVER. Show a child coughing into the elbow.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.912
VENTILATE. Show fresh air flowing through suitable classroom windows.
